https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/instacart-cart-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2024 Q2","e":"cart","d":"2024-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Emily Reuter","x":"This includes our third consecutive quarter of positive GAAP net income of $61 million, which was down quarter over quarter primarily due to ongoing noise in SBC following our IPO in September 2023, and the $95 million of restructuring and executive-related reversals we experienced in Q1 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/instacart-cart-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2024 Q3","e":"cart","d":"2024-11-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Fidji Simo","x":"This is especially true with our ongoing investments in AI, which build on more than a decade of specialized grocery data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/instacart-cart-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2024 Q3","e":"cart","d":"2024-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emily Reuter","x":"As you know, we did do a restructuring in Q1, and that did reduce head count, although I will note that the company actually peaked head count in Q2 of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/12/instacart-cart-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2024 Q4","e":"cart","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Ross Sandler","x":"So, you guys mentioned how you're using AI to track store inventory and substitutions and, ultimately, reduce the error rates of ordering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/25/instacart-cart-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2025 Q2","e":"cart","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fidji Simo","x":"That's not just tariffs, but I would say regulation at large, whether it's SNAP, food dyes, etcetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/instacart-cart-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2025 Q4","e":"cart","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Rogers","x":"Finally, I want to spend a few minutes on AI because it's no longer about just about making teams faster or more productive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/instacart-cart-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CART 2026 Q2","e":"cart","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Rogers","x":"We are gonna keep investing here, and we are gonna we expect AI to remain a durable source of our advertising innovation going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/maplebear-cart-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[55,1,8432,0,0,0,6514,1419],[56,1,9326,0,0,0,7163,1635],[57,1,9351,0,0,0,7426,1358],[58,1,9177,0,0,0,5448,3206],[59,1,9597,0,0,0,7784,1365],[60,1,9668,0,0,0,7966,1230],[62,1,9679,0,0,0,9383,102],[64,1,9338,0,0,0,7665,1015],[65,1,9699,0,0,0,8435,996],[66,1,10311,0,0,0,8237,1623]],"cinema":[[55,1,8432,0,0,0,6514,1419],[56,1,9326,0,0,0,7163,1635],[57,1,9351,0,0,0,7426,1358],[58,1,9177,0,0,0,5448,3206],[59,1,9597,0,0,0,7784,1365],[60,1,9668,0,0,0,7966,1230],[62,1,9679,0,0,0,9383,102],[64,1,9338,0,0,0,7665,1015],[65,1,9699,0,0,0,8435,996],[66,1,10311,0,0,0,8237,1623]],"imax":[[55,1,8432,0,0,0,6514,1419],[56,1,9326,0,0,0,7163,1635],[57,1,9351,0,0,0,7426,1358],[58,1,9177,0,0,0,5448,3206],[59,1,9597,0,0,0,7784,1365],[60,1,9668,0,0,0,7966,1230],[62,1,9679,0,0,0,9383,102],[64,1,9338,0,0,0,7665,1015],[65,1,9699,0,0,0,8435,996],[66,1,10311,0,0,0,8237,1623]],"streaming":[[55,1,8432,0,0,0,6514,1419],[56,1,9326,0,0,0,7163,1635],[57,1,9351,0,0,0,7426,1358],[58,1,9177,0,0,0,5448,3206],[59,1,9597,0,0,0,7784,1365],[60,1,9668,0,0,0,7966,1230],[62,1,9679,0,0,0,9383,102],[64,1,9338,0,0,0,7665,1015],[65,1,9699,0,0,0,8435,996],[66,1,10311,0,0,0,8237,1623]],"dtc":[[55,1,8432,0,0,0,6514,1419],[56,1,9326,0,0,0,7163,1635],[57,1,9351,0,0,0,7426,1358],[58,1,